I was playing against Kaargra, and by the time the battle was over, we had 44 favor to the Bloodsworn&#39;s 11.&nbsp; This was mostly produced by Expatriette holding onto Mindbreaker, Seeker, and Indiscriminate all at once. &nbsp;(Admittedly, getting this victory took 3 tries. &nbsp;The first two had Kaargra getting ridiculous numbers of titles. &nbsp;(In the first game, she got Chaos Lord, and then we got Lost in the Past, and the second game had Kaargra getting the Seeker/Mindbreaker/Indiscriminate combo)

&nbsp;

This got me wondering how much favor we could aquire before the match was declared over. &nbsp;So I thought I&#39;d start a challenge in the manner of MarioFanatic&#39;s [url=https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/challenge-raw-damage-6974]Raw Damage Challenge[/url]. &nbsp;(The difference being that favor is harder to accumulate at absurd levels than damage is.) &nbsp;The rules are the same: submit a screenshot and get added to the leaderboard. &nbsp;Ranking is determined by how much favor the heroes accumulated, with no regard for how well the Bloodsworn did (although you must have achieved victory in order to be counted), but there is a bonus category for getting an exact multiple of the Bloodsworn&#39;s score.

